{"1913310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Undead Tread", "steam_appid": 1913310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended, but the road never stops. In this high-speed vehicular roguelike, you’ll drive, fight, and upgrade your way through an undead-infested wasteland. Armed with front-mounted guns and whatever scrap you can salvage, you must push forward through procedurally generated rural roads, highways, and crumbling cities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Shoot, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're behind the wheel of humanity’s last hope: a heavily armed, upgradable death machine. Keep your speed high and your reflexes sharp as you blast through zombie hordes and giant deadly bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.poster.avif?t=1780110126\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.webm?t=1780110126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/4ea76a839c97a1be6dd99782511c2910.mp4?t=1780110126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ultimate Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is your tank, and keeping it in top shape is the key. Choose from a collection of over 40 cards, ranging from consumables to weapon and vehicle upgrades. Permanently progress by upgrading the cards and come back stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/579f9060870693e140a7d73cbe2be881.poster.avif?t=1780110126\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/579f9060870693e140a7d73cbe2be881.webm?t=1780110126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/579f9060870693e140a7d73cbe2be881.mp4?t=1780110126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Roads, Endless Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Every highway, backroad, and ruined city is procedurally generated, offering new layouts, enemy encounters, biomes, weather and challenges with each playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/85c9b92cfe14455f02734f245d01bfb2.poster.avif?t=1780110126\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/85c9b92cfe14455f02734f245d01bfb2.webm?t=1780110126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1913310/extras/85c9b92cfe14455f02734f245d01bfb2.mp4?t=1780110126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has ended, but the road never stops. In this high-speed vehicular roguelike, you’ll drive, fight, and upgrade your way through an undead-infested wasteland. Armed with front-mounted guns and whatever scrap you can salvage, you must push forward through procedurally generated rural roads, highways, and crumbling cities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Shoot, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're behind the wheel of humanity’s last hope: a heavily 